<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 8.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 8.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 08	Jan 07	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  246.490     245.530     247.020   -0.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.500     305.120     306.830   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.730     157.270     158.970   -1.41 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.420	46.530	47.182   -1.62 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  416.140     416.100     419.180   -0.73 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.640     141.130     141.685   -1.44 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.990	16.000	16.185   -1.20 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.680     212.670     212.430    0.12 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.870	 1.870	 1.888   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.565	 1.570	 1.581   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.400     181.585     183.135   -0.95 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
